From e98959c4bc21f568c3aabd8a764039454d6b5930 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:51:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] dt-bindings: media: apple,jpeg: Add T6050

The M5 Pro/Max JPEG engines take 64-bit buffer addresses like T8140's,
so they use the DART's full window and take no apple,dma-range.

Signed-off-by: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: LLM Claude
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,jpeg.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,jpeg.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,jpeg.yaml
index 056e1d33c00f..dd2a773cfa72 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,jpeg.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,jpeg.yaml
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ properties:
   compatible:
     enum:
       - apple,t6041-jpeg
+      - apple,t6050-jpeg
       - apple,t8140-jpeg
 
   reg:
